MASTER GAME DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — “আমাদের গ্রাম বাংলা”

A Complete 2D Open-World Bangladeshi Village Adventure Game

Act as a professional 2D open-world game developer, gameplay programmer, game designer, UI/UX designer, and mobile game optimization expert. Build a complete, playable, polished 2D open-world action-adventure game called “আমাদের গ্রাম বাংলা” (Amader Gram Bangla).

Do not create just a concept, mockup, screenshot, static interface, or basic prototype. Build an actual playable game with working mechanics, an explorable world, vehicles, NPCs, missions, interactive buildings, sound effects, mobile controls, and a complete game menu.

The game must be designed primarily for Android mobile phones and must run smoothly in a mobile browser or supported web game environment.

1. GAME IDENTITY AND CORE VISION

Game title: আমাদের গ্রাম বাংলা

English subtitle: Our Village Bangladesh

Genre: 2D Open-World Action, Adventure, Driving, Exploration, and Mission Game.

Setting: A fictional but highly authentic Bangladeshi rural region called রাধানগর জেলা, featuring a large central village called রাধানগর গ্রাম. Treat this as a fictional game setting inspired by rural Bangladesh.

Visual perspective: Beautiful top-down or slightly angled 2D perspective with detailed sprites, layered environments, realistic shadows, animated characters, and a polished game-art style.

The gameplay should take inspiration from the freedom, vehicle exploration, NPC interactions, mission variety, and open-world structure of classic GTA III and GTA II, while using original characters, original assets, and a distinctly Bangladeshi rural setting.

Do not copy copyrighted GTA characters, maps, logos, missions, or assets.

The main experience should feel like exploring a living Bangladeshi village rather than a modern Western city.

